99	// and the API finds a cached prefix only at a breakpoint or within twenty blocks before one, so a prefix ending at
100	// the first result a deeper ask drops, mid-conversation, is never found: measured 2026-11-02 (mlflow PR26265, smoke6),
101	// two deeper asks read 12,707 tokens each, the system prompt, and wrote 60k, the whole post-clear context, where the
