158	// An agent routed through a model server of its own that reaches the proxy by mistake (proxy-route.js): its token
159	// was minted for that server, so forwarding the request to api.anthropic.com fails every call of every session of
160	// that harness, and the proxy is the one thing in the path the person did not put there. Two signs, in order of
161	// certainty: credentials that cannot be Anthropic's, and the API refusing them AUTH_REFUSALS times running. Either
162	// one stands the service down once (commands/proxy.js, proxy-service.js:standDown), so the next session goes
